<section class="archive-layout"><header class="archive-header"><span class="eyebrow">10,000 SWORDS AGAINST HEAVEN</span><h2>Compendium Browser</h2><p>Find an item. Drag it onto your character.</p></header><div class="archive-filters"><label>Search<input data-filter="query" type="search" value="{{filters.query}}" placeholder="Name, tag:fire, sect:asuri, sidhi:2…" aria-label="Search compendiums"></label><label>Type<select data-filter="type"><option value="">All types</option>{{selectOptions types selected=filters.type}}</select></label><label>Source<select data-filter="source"><option value="">All sources</option>{{selectOptions sources selected=filters.source}}</select></label><button type="button" data-action="refresh" title="Reload compendium indexes">Refresh</button></div><p>Search names and descriptions, or use tag:, sect:, sidhi:, rank:, and rarity: filters.</p><p class="archive-count">{{shown}} of {{count}} entries</p>{{#if failures}}<p class="capacity-warning">Could not load: {{failures}}. Try Refresh.</p>{{/if}}<ul class="archive-results">{{#each rows}}<li draggable="true" data-uuid="{{uuid}}"><img src="{{img}}" alt="" loading="lazy"><div><strong>{{name}}</strong><small>{{typeLabel}} · {{source}}</small></div><button type="button" data-action="inspect" data-uuid="{{uuid}}">View</button></li>{{else}}<li class="archive-empty">No matching items. Try another filter, create a world item, or enable an Item compendium.</li>{{/each}}</ul>{{#if more}}<button type="button" data-action="more">Load more</button>{{/if}}</section>